# Browser
# Divine Intervention at a table, Bot1 a browser page: its upkeep ability removes its last intervention counter in Bot1's
# turn 3 upkeep, Bot1 having removed it, so the game is a draw (CR 104.4c), and the page says why - the game log, which the
# game-over panel reads its detail from, says an effect made the game a draw. The headless scenarios say when it triggers
# and when it doesn't.

[Bot1 Deck]
Divine Intervention
Black Lotus
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Mox Emerald
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

[Actions]
